Subject: [PATCH 12/19] ttf: read a legacy kern table as kerning

A font that kerns with a kern table and no GPOS kern feature lost all its
kerning. Its horizontal format 0 pairs are now the default master's kerning,
the pairs of several subtables added up, as a shaper applies them; when GPOS
has a kern feature the kern table is left alone, as a shaper leaves it.

Assisted by an AI agent (Claude Opus 5.5)
